..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : PARTNERID.EV
.. Autor          : mh/ok
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : carue
.. Funktion       : Allgemeine Events, hier: Auswahl des Vorgangs
.. Functionality  : General Events, here: pick process/message type
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
..
..  Event evaluation
.. ----------- ----- Header -------- -------------------------------------------
.. Inserting and Deleting rows is allowed!
.. inserting an empty row does not change the data (new data is caught on field exit)
.. ----------- ---------- ---------- -------------------------------------------
.continue END     ? G|evtartengl="ROW_INSERTION_BEFORE"
.continue CHANGE  ? G|evtartengl="ROW_MOVE_BEFORE"
.continue CHANGE  ? G|evtartengl="ROW_DELETION_BEFORE"
.continue CHANGE  ? G|evtartengl="FIELD_EXIT"
.. ----------- ---------- ---------- -------------------------------------------
.continue END
..
!CHANGE
.copy M|abbrfrage = G|true
.continue END
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
